  "name": {
   "zh": "生成 · QwenImage",
   "en": "Generate · QwenImage"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Qwen-Image 2.1 统一文生图与图像编辑（7B DiT + Qwen3-VL 编码器，原生 RGBA）。一个节点三种用法，按「模式」切换：文生图（写提示词、选比例与分辨率）、图像编辑（接一张「图像」）、多参考图（「图像」一张 + 「参考图」列表，至多 10 张）。输出一张静帧 RGBA；透明背景按官方写法在提示词里注明。权重 Qwen Research License（仅限研究评估，商用需另行授权）；需管理员授予「生成式扩散」能力。",
   "en": "Qwen-Image 2.1 unifies text-to-image and image editing (7B DiT + Qwen3-VL encoder, native RGBA). Mode switches between text-to-image, image editing (wire one Image) and multiple references (one Image plus up to 10 Reference Images). It outputs one still RGBA; ask for a transparent background in the prompt. Qwen Research License (research only); an administrator must grant Generative Diffusion."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-10-02T12:00:00",
  "deliverable": "image_text",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
